From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:40:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132: name the video encoder
 resources

The encoder driver maps its codec, mailbox and coprocessor windows and
attaches its power domains by name. The T8132 node had neither name
list: its windows were in ADT order (codec, coproc, mailbox, PMGR VENC
page, a 16 MiB window of unknown role) and its domains started with
VENC_SYS, the parent of VENC_DMA, so the driver could not bind.

Order and name the windows as on the T6041, whose codec, mailbox and
coprocessor sit at the same offsets from the block, and list the five
VENC domains the driver expects, leaving VENC_SYS to come in as the
parent of VENC_DMA. Still disabled.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 4b304adfb1b2df511b70e86775dacfe8e747d24c)
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-peripherals.dtsi | 12 ++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-peripherals.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-peripherals.dtsi
index f291e5161a..a222fbc4c7 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-peripherals.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-peripherals.dtsi
@@ -346,20 +346,28 @@
 		status = "okay";
 	};
 
+	/*
+	 * ADT /arm-io/ave lists codec, coproc, mailbox, the PMGR VENC page and
+	 * a 16 MiB window of unknown role. They sit at the same offsets from
+	 * the block as on the T6041, so they are ordered and named as there.
+	 */
 	ave: video-encoder@421100000 {
 		compatible = "apple,t8132-ave", "apple,ave";
 		reg = <0x4 0x21100000 0x0 0x45c000>,
-		      <0x4 0x21800000 0x0 0x800000>,
 		      <0x4 0x21050000 0x0 0x4000>,
+		      <0x4 0x21800000 0x0 0x800000>,
 		      <0x3 0x80708000 0x0 0x4000>,
 		      <0x4 0x20000000 0x0 0x1000000>;
+		reg-names = "codec", "mailbox", "coproc", "pmgr", "fabric";
 		interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
 		interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 970 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 		             <AIC_IRQ 964 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 		             <AIC_IRQ 963 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 		             <AIC_IRQ 966 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 		             <AIC_IRQ 965 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
-		power-domains = <&ps_venc_sys>, <&ps_venc_pipe4>, <&ps_venc_pipe5>, <&ps_venc_me0>, <&ps_venc_me1>, <&ps_venc_dma>;
+		power-domains = <&ps_venc_dma>, <&ps_venc_pipe4>, <&ps_venc_pipe5>,
+				<&ps_venc_me0>, <&ps_venc_me1>;
+		power-domain-names = "dma", "pipe4", "pipe5", "me0", "me1";
 		iommus = <&dart_ave0 0>, <&dart_ave1 0>;
 		clocks = <&peripheral_clocks 430>;
 		status = "disabled";
-- 
